# Prebuild output. This project uses Expo's managed/prebuild workflow
# (app.json holds ios.bundleIdentifier, infoPlist, plugins, etc.); the
# ios/ + android/ folders are regenerated by `expo prebuild` and EAS
# builds. Committing them would actively break cloud builds — EAS skips
# app.json native config when these folders are tracked. Per-developer
# ephemeral.
ios/
android/
